        "content": "# Section 2 - Fix Broken Workflow\n\nOwned By: Your Name\nLast Updated: Date\n\nIntentionally broken workflow for debugging practice.\nThis workflow had 3 issues that were fixed.\n\n## Expected Flow (when fixed)\n1. TriggerManual: Starts workflow\n2. GetOrders: Fetches order data from Academy API\n3. GetCustomers: Fetches customer data from Academy API\n4. SetFallbackCustomer: Provides fallback if GetCustomers fails\n5. MergeOrdersCustomers: Joins orders with customer data\n6. SendToOrdersQueue: Submits enriched orders for validation\n\n## Issues Fixed\n1. GetOrders: Missing Header Auth credential and X-Assessment-ID\n2. MergeOrdersCustomers: Match field was \"customerId\" instead of \"customer_id\"\n3. SendToOrdersQueue: Referenced deleted \"AggregateOrders\" node\n\n## Validation Endpoint\n- POST /webhook/course/foundations/s5/debug-result\n- Returns confirmation code when all issues are fixed\n\nPart of: n8n Foundations Program N8N103 Course, Section 2",
